 dclock - digital clock for G-windows Copyright 1996 by High-G Software. Usage: dclock [options]     options:         -m = use 24 hour format (default = 12 hour format).         -h = don't hibernate on startup.              (window appears in lower left corner of you screen Personally I prefer analog watches to digital but I figured a computer needs to have a digital timepiece so I wrote one. As usual, any complaints, bug reports or job offers can be sent to me at:    Stephen Carville    pagan@delphi.com    High G Software    P.O Box 822    Glendora, CA 91740    (818) 914-2511